            <li>Rich Interactive Test Database (RITdb) and STDFv4 Support</li>
            <li>Link test resources with user-defined tags</li>
            <li>Versioning file system keeps a complete test development history</li>
            <li>File and data redundancy with automated backups</li>
            <li>Search, filter, and organize files quickly and efficiently</li>
            <li class="hidden-xs" style="margin-left: 55%;">
